at and connect via VR.\n- Credits give you the power of interactive communication without limits.\n- Your account will be charged once you confirm your purchase.\n- One-time in-app purchases for credits used to access premium VR chats. No subscription required.\nOur platform includes content moderation tools to ensure a safe experience.", "short_description": "Experience immersive 3D dating in VR with singles from around the world.\nDating.com VR offers 1-on-1 video chats with matches who share your interests.\nExplore a new dimension of dating with VR technology from Dating.com.\nA fun new way to connect!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vr.dating.com/landing/app/terms/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vr.dating.com/landing/app/terms/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "SOL Networks Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.dating.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9378517945592780"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1185494635945753"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1185494635945753"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1749818520, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1185494635945753"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results